{# =========================================================================
   REVIEW PAGE · THE CELESTIAL RESEARCHER
   Static close-ups of the two hands from the Public Thinking scene, each
   beside its anatomical construction (solid volumes, joints, no stars), plus
   the full composition. Same builder as the homepage section (researcher.js),
   same geometry; only the viewBox differs. Nothing here animates.
   ========================================================================= #}
